Third-party components

Nexspence links Go and JavaScript dependencies distributed under their own
permissive licenses (MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0). Their terms travel with them; see
go.mod, go.sum and frontend/package-lock.json for the authoritative list.

The container image also ships the Trivy scanner (Apache-2.0), which Nexspence
invokes as a separate executable rather than linking, and therefore distributes
under Trivy's own terms.
